.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt CHECK 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm check
.Nd zdots shell integrity check
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
validates the zsh configuration layer: shell syntax, startup and loading
behaviour, key bindings and safe mode, then runs the bats test suite.
It is the CI-safe health gate for the shell; platform services are checked by
.Xr zdots-ctl 8 .
.Pp
It takes no options and has no
.Fl -help :
any invocation runs the full check.
Run it through
.Ic make check ,
or
.Ic make check-fast
to skip external dependency checks.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_CHECK_STRICT_BREW
.It Ev ZDOTS_CHECK_SKIP_EXTERNAL
Set to
.Ql 1
to skip checks that need external tools (Homebrew, Powerlevel10k).
.It Ev ZDOTS_CHECK_STRICT_BREW
Set to
.Ql 1
to fail, rather than warn, when the host's Brewfile is not satisfied.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-ctl 8 ,
.Xr zdots-doctor 1
